# Development mode overrides
# VITE_API_BASE_URL is intentionally NOT set here.
# It inherits from .env (gitignored) so each developer can point to their
# own local machine IP, e.g.: VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.XX:8000
#
# For physical Android device testing: use your local machine IP in .env
# For web browser testing: use http://localhost:8000 in .env
